**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.local
# Both apps' __generated__ dirs are checked into git and deliberately NOT
# excluded here: frontend's build runs `tsc` before `relay-compiler`
# regenerates its Relay artifacts (needs the committed copies present from
# the start), and relay-compiler itself reads bff's checked-in
# schema.graphql (frontend/package.json's relay config points at it) even
# though the BFF never reads that file at runtime.
.git
